{
  "info": {
    "name": "Order Monitoring API",
    "description": "Коллекция для быстрого тестирования обеих версий проекта.\n\nВерсии и порты:\n- broken-version -> http://localhost:8080\n- fixed-version -> http://localhost:8081\n\nHost-порты PostgreSQL изменены на 5433 и 5434, но эта коллекция работает только с HTTP API.\n\nПосле импорта в Postman откройте нужную папку и сразу видно, к какой версии идёт запрос.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "broken_base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "fixed_base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8081",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "broken_order_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "fixed_order_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "fixed_manual_order_number",
      "value": "POSTMAN-FIXED-001",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "client_iterations",
      "value": "8",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "client_delay_ms",
      "value": "600",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "concurrent_payment_requests",
      "value": "12",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "broken_load_order_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "fixed_load_order_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Broken Version · localhost:8080",
      "description": "Сценарии для broken-version. Здесь есть запросы, которые специально приводят к ошибкам или нежелательному поведению.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{broken_base_url}}/health",
            "description": "Проверка, что broken-version поднята на порту 8080."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Products",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{broken_base_url}}/products",
            "description": "Список товаров из broken-version."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Order · success with explicit order_number",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "let data = null;",
                  "try { data = pm.response.json(); } catch (e) {}",
                  "if (data && data.id) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('broken_order_id', String(data.id));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"product_id\": 1,\n  \"quantity\": 1,\n  \"customer_email\": \"broken-success@example.com\",\n  \"order_number\": \"BROKEN-{{$timestamp}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{broken_base_url}}/orders",
            "description": "Успешное создание заказа в broken-version. Используется явный уникальный order_number, чтобы не попасть в демонстрационный duplicate bug. ID заказа сохраняется в переменную broken_order_id."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Created Order By ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{broken_base_url}}/orders/{{broken_order_id}}",
            "description": "Получение заказа из broken-version по ID, который был сохранён после Create Order."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Capture Payment For Order",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{broken_base_url}}/orders/{{broken_order_id}}/payments",
            "description": "Обычная одиночная оплата заказа в broken-version."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "List Payments For Order",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{broken_base_url}}/orders/{{broken_order_id}}/payments",
            "description": "Показывает список платежей. После нагрузочного запуска у broken-version здесь может оказаться несколько записей."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Duplicate Bug Demo · first request",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"product_id\": 1,\n  \"quantity\": 1,\n  \"customer_email\": \"duplicate@example.com\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{broken_base_url}}/orders",
            "description": "Первый запрос без order_number. В broken-version backend подставляет фиксированный ORDER-DEMO-DUPLICATE."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Duplicate Bug Demo · second request (expect 500)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"product_id\": 1,\n  \"quantity\": 1,\n  \"customer_email\": \"duplicate@example.com\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{broken_base_url}}/orders",
            "description": "Повтор того же запроса. Ожидается ошибка unique constraint / duplicate key из-за фиксированного order_number."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Discount Panic Demo (expect 500 / panic recovery)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"price\": 1000,\n  \"discount_percent\": 0\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{broken_base_url}}/orders/discount",
            "description": "Демонстрация panic в broken-version: discount_percent = 0 приводит к division by zero."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Slow Request Demo (~3s)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"product_id\": 1,\n  \"quantity\": 1,\n  \"customer_email\": \"slow@example.com\",\n  \"order_number\": \"SLOW-{{$timestamp}}\",\n  \"simulate_slow\": true\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{broken_base_url}}/orders",
            "description": "Запрос для broken-version, который должен выполняться примерно 3 секунды."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Presentation Runner · Broken Load",
      "description": "Запускайте эту папку через Postman Collection Runner. Она имитирует поток клиентов за короткий период: просмотр товаров, создание заказов, чтение заказа, расчет скидки. После цикла запускаются демонстрационные ошибки broken-version.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Broken Load · Start",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('broken API is available', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('broken_client_i', '0');",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('broken_run_session', String(Date.now()));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('broken_load_order_id', '');",
                  "pm.execution.setNextRequest('Broken Load · Browse products');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{broken_base_url}}/health",
            "description": "Старт сценария: сбрасывает счетчики Runner и проверяет доступность broken-version."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Broken Load · Browse products",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('products loaded', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.execution.setNextRequest('Broken Load · Create client order');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{broken_base_url}}/products",
            "description": "Клиент открывает каталог товаров."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Broken Load · Create client order",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const i = Number(pm.collectionVariables.get('broken_client_i') || 0) + 1;",
                  "const session = pm.collectionVariables.get('broken_run_session') || Date.now();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('client_email', `broken-client-${session}-${i}@example.com`);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('client_quantity', String((i % 3) + 1));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('client_order_number', `BROKEN-LOAD-${session}-${i}`);"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('order created', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('broken_load_order_id', String(data.id));",
                  "const i = Number(pm.collectionVariables.get('broken_client_i') || 0) + 1;",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('broken_client_i', String(i));",
                  "pm.execution.setNextRequest('Broken Load · Get client order');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"product_id\": 1,\n  \"quantity\": {{client_quantity}},\n  \"customer_email\": \"{{client_email}}\",\n  \"order_number\": \"{{client_order_number}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{broken_base_url}}/orders",
            "description": "Клиент создает заказ. Для основной нагрузки order_number уникальный, чтобы поток не остановился на duplicate bug раньше времени."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Broken Load · Get client order",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('order is readable', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.execution.setNextRequest('Broken Load · Calculate normal discount');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{broken_base_url}}/orders/{{broken_load_order_id}}",
            "description": "Клиент обновляет экран заказа."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Broken Load · Calculate normal discount",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('discount calculated', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "const delay = Number(pm.collectionVariables.get('client_delay_ms') || 0);",
                  "const until = Date.now() + delay;",
                  "while (Date.now() < until) {}",
                  "const i = Number(pm.collectionVariables.get('broken_client_i') || 0);",
                  "const max = Number(pm.collectionVariables.get('client_iterations') || 1);",
                  "if (i < max) {",
                  "  pm.execution.setNextRequest('Broken Load · Browse products');",
                  "} else {",
                  "  pm.execution.setNextRequest('Broken Load · Duplicate order first');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"price\": 1000,\n  \"discount_percent\": 10\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{broken_base_url}}/orders/discount",
            "description": "Обычный расчет скидки внутри пользовательского потока."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Broken Load · Duplicate order first",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.execution.setNextRequest('Broken Load · Duplicate order second');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"product_id\": 1,\n  \"quantity\": 1,\n  \"customer_email\": \"broken-duplicate-runner@example.com\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{broken_base_url}}/orders",
            "description": "Первый запрос без order_number. В broken-version backend подставляет фиксированный ORDER-DEMO-DUPLICATE."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Broken Load · Duplicate order second",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('broken duplicate becomes server error', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([500]);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.execution.setNextRequest('Broken Load · Discount panic');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"product_id\": 1,\n  \"quantity\": 1,\n  \"customer_email\": \"broken-duplicate-runner@example.com\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{broken_base_url}}/orders",
            "description": "Второй такой же запрос показывает 500 и запись ошибки в мониторинге/логах."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Broken Load · Discount panic",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('broken discount panic is visible', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([500]);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.execution.setNextRequest('Broken Load · Slow request');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"price\": 1000,\n  \"discount_percent\": 0\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{broken_base_url}}/orders/discount",
            "description": "Финальный баг в сценарии: division by zero, который хорошо виден в Sentry и Elastic."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Broken Load · Slow request",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('slow request still creates order', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.execution.setNextRequest(null);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"product_id\": 1,\n  \"quantity\": 1,\n  \"customer_email\": \"broken-slow-runner@example.com\",\n  \"order_number\": \"BROKEN-SLOW-{{$timestamp}}\",\n  \"simulate_slow\": true\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{broken_base_url}}/orders",
            "description": "Медленный запрос примерно на 3 секунды для графиков latency."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Presentation Runner · Fixed Load",
      "description": "Та же последовательность для fixed-version. Для демонстрации достаточно запустить эту папку после Broken Load и сравнить HTTP-коды, latency и ошибки в Elastic/Sentry.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Fixed Load · Start",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('fixed API is available', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('fixed_client_i', '0');",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('fixed_run_session', String(Date.now()));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('fixed_duplicate_order_number', `FIXED-RUNNER-DUPLICATE-${Date.now()}`);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('fixed_load_order_id', '');",
                  "pm.execution.setNextRequest('Fixed Load · Browse products');"
